    {"dot":"cyan","title":"B07c scope (releases, comms, webhooks)","items":["Completes B07-guardrails-ops. Modules: service-release (5/2), changelog (7/2), notification (4/1), webhook (7/1) = 23 routes / 6 controllers.","Service releases: admin + internal release endpoints (internal controller has @Public/@ApiExcludeController/tenant-lock patterns; verify auth). Changelog: public /changelog and /admin/changelog.","Notifications: /admin/notifications. Webhooks: /admin/webhooks subscription/management/delivery surfaces. Grouped endpoint nodes for readability."]},
